{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_st03",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_st03",
  "title": "粘劫收後",
  "storyCode": "WB-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4b758cd5ed22c5e4556df0d8312664a37613019ee5a51815aada803ea68ee6e9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g11_yanroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_790_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "林先生，怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生說沒有大礙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是之前受了傷，又那樣拼命使用源石技藝，過於勞累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸他畢竟上了年紀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_790_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有時都忘了，林先生，已經為龍門操勞了這麼久......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸和魏長官不一樣。魏長官是龍門的象徵，他必須時時刻刻出現在大眾的視野裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可要是人人都時常記得下城區有一位鼠王，對龍門而言並非一件好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_790_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說了，這次的麻煩事，是魏彥吾捲你進來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然我接下了，那就是我自己的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且多虧了某人，我最終也沒出事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_790_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也多虧這次機會，讓我想明白了一些問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_790_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你接下來準備去維多利亞？我們可以同路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會回龍門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_790_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“回龍門”的意思是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "留下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“扔下包袱”是句漂亮話，一個人扔下的，總得有另一個人撿起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是去是留都是一個人的自由，但總要有人去照顧龍門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_790_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這句話是我說給自己聽的，但你要是覺得我在批評你，我也很樂意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_790_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還有精神說這些廢話，我倒是放心了一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鼠王的女兒，不一定是鼠王。但也可以是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者是，一個不一樣的“鼠王”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一次，是我自己選的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龍門有貧民區，但是不該有貧民區。這是件困難的事，也是不管多少年過去，都需要有人努力去做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時代在向前走，但是不該有人被拋下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_790_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這句話從你口中說出來，我可以相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_790_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "話說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有話直說，怎麼連你也會支支吾吾的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_790_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這幾天，你有沒有見過魏彥吾......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宗師要走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交接完公務，這就離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，我得對魏兄道謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這又從何說起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏兄的確相信了玉門一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也相信了，我的一些朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事情已經結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然受了些損失，但事態還在掌控之內。已經是不幸中的萬幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最重要的是，我看到了，不管多少年過去，這裡的人們還是能團結一心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門還是那個玉門。“人定勝天”，不是虛言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣一來，我也能放心離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一次告別，就真的不知何時才能再見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前路山長水遠，宗師珍重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "廟堂風雲詭譎，魏公也該當心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宗師的提醒，我會放在心上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......突然想起，宗師昨天評價過陳的劍術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“爐火純青，但不算登峰造極。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是這樣講過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陳在劍術上有天賦，但畢竟修煉赤霄劍法的時日不算久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赤霄劍法的精髓，她還沒有得到要領。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來魏公是要露一手武功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前向宗師提起過，雲裂之劍，並非赤霄劍法的最後一式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "以指為劍。\n沒有劍氣激蕩，卻隱隱有風，杯中茶水泛起漣漪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赤霄的最後一式，名為天瞠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劍意如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天瞠之劍，當絕則絕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "心法如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不破不立，破而後立。雲裂之後，方能見蒼穹怒目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不除心間迷障，不能領會劍意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關隘如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劍隨心動，招出無悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若一念回首，則劍失鋒芒，反害其身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人離席，風還飄蕩了許久。\n男人盯著茶杯中的水紋沉思良久，終於露出一絲笑意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來世上還有這樣的劍法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g7_zuosroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "進來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_038",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "見過太傅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們可清楚，你們擅入玉門，已大有違逆之嫌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_038",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_038",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏公遭遇刺殺，又被困在玉門城中，而玉門駛向京城......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_038",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "屬下牽掛魏公安危。事出突然，容不得我們權衡得失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_038",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏公知遇之恩，屬下唯有以性命相報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏彥吾是不是吩咐你們，如果三日內，他沒有回到龍門，就讓你們來玉門找他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_038",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太傅明鑒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在可以告訴你們，魏彥吾的遇刺還有玉門遭受的危機，都是意外之事。你們不用多慮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_038",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "屬下已經清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天災發生時，你們在何處？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_038",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暗中協助城中軍民清剿逆黨，無人察覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總算你們做了件應該做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你們可以走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_038",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......太傅不治屬下的罪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在禁軍的名簿上，你們已經是死人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今日我從未見過你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_038",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太傅都已經知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從一開始便知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也從來沒有打算瞞著我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太傅該責怪我越俎代庖了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "此次事態沒有失控，離不開你從龍門帶來的那位年輕特使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次玉門的動亂，太尉很快就會得知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只怕不是“很快”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這正是我要來玉門的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對歲獸的態度，是戰是和，怎樣才是最優解，到現在也難有定論。所有人身在局中，很難看清全盤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只怕有些局中人的心思，已經不在尋找那個正確答案上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有意幫平祟侯剷除亂黨，是出於對炎國的責任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要你還記得自己的職責，就不用我來教你該怎麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太傅曾經的教誨，從來不敢忘懷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的確是個很好的學生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還記得，你與你胞弟兒時一同在我門下讀書，你總是學得更快的那個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g1_yumenstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你受了傷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "掛了點彩，不礙事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽幾位土木天師提起，護住沙渠，多虧了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜讓那人跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，我是來向你告別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以後不用跟在你身邊，我也要找一個能讓這把劍發揮作用的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你的話，想必不難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們之間沒有仇恨了，但我沒有放下超過你的念頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等我覺得自己劍術練成的時候，依然會來找你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是那句話，等你做好了準備，隨時可以來找我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後會有期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就不覺得遺憾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼遺憾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萬一哪天，祂一場大夢做罷，你我都化為虛無。留她一個人，要向何處求索？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在這個年紀，就已經能放下“仇恨”的執念，將來我消失不見，她把對我的記憶都一併忘記，便又放下一層執念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那她在武學這條路上，前途豈不是不可限量？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳武授業，畢竟你是“宗師”，我說不過你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，這次令妹在甕城之上獨退天災，如此神采，恐怕又要留下一段傳說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒印象，只記得當時喝醉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酒醒提壺去，滄桑入詩篇。此間事了，大哥接下來要去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去年和夕待的地方看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g6_yumengate"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "觀棋的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哎，那邊那人，自己和自己下棋，下了一個下午了。也不說話，也不邀請別人對弈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "觀棋的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那棋路招法的確精妙，但棋風刁鑽詭異，有幾步我也看得稀里糊塗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "觀棋的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是哪位沒聽過名字的大國手？可怎麼會來玉門這種地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "街邊的棋館門外，一人獨自面對著棋盤。並不是在打譜，他每落一子，都要沉思許久，似是在苦苦與自己為敵。\n粗糙的木製棋盤上，黑白石子縱橫交錯，數塊棋子彼此纏鬥不休，觀棋者一時目眩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棋客",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您也會下棋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "略懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棋客",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那這盤殘局，你覺得局勢怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看得出，棋盤上三處戰鬥均已告一段落，局面大抵兩分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是白棋中央勢力寬廣，全域又無孤棋。這樣下去，黑棋以半目之差落敗，似乎是不可避免......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棋客？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再仔細算算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "棋客？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我教過你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "角上，留有一劫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......粘劫收後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白棋勢廣，執棋者的後顧之憂就更多......我的劫材，也就更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "棋局還未盡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不會放棄的。這盤棋，你一定要分個勝負。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "棋局無趣，要分勝負的，是我與我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g6_yumengate"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的那把劍，讓我學到了一些事情。這一盤殘局，就當作給你的回禮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜到了，在我身邊肯定有你布下的棋子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是沒有想到，早在那時起，你就對人類，失去了希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人獸有別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你將自己封印入劍，換來一副人的身體。你將自己當作他們中的一個，可最終，你又得到了什麼下場？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "故友散盡，孤身遠走。無人信任，無人知曉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你並非不懂人心，不，你太懂了。千百年來，你一直是與他們接觸最深的那個，你怎麼會不懂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正是因為你深知人心難測，你才無法融入其中。你始終是異類。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "頡消失後，這些年你做的這一切，也不過是為了給自己找一個能說上話的對手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們都寂寞太久了，總想找人說說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們爭鬥多年，竟然成了最瞭解彼此的那個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的敵人，從來都不是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從來沒有將你當作敵人......哪怕當年，阻止我的，是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你的棋局會牽扯更多人，我還是會阻止你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你當然會，前提是，你能看見全局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們還會再見的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保重，兄長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "重岳拾起一顆白子，落在棋盤一角。\n“啪”。\n正招本手，不偏不倚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這本書是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二十年前，老師便想要撰寫這本《武典》。只是為玉門戍邊，事務繁忙，一直耽擱著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "五年前，經他口述，終於由我開始代為執筆整理，昨日方才完稿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其中記錄了老師對於天下武學的觀察和感悟，源流演化，宗法萬千，盡在其中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老師讓我將這本書送與將軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "《武典》正篇之外，另附了一套功法，老師說拳腳形意，與病理相通，勤加練習，或許對您的身體有幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宗師人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "半個時辰前，已經離開玉門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老師說，“那個客人”他已經送走，將軍可以安心處理災後事務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他就不來告別了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你為何沒隨他同去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十歲那年，我被老師從那場劫難中救下，便跟在老師身邊，長大後替他記錄武功，隨他見識各種英雄人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老師說，我若志在武學，這十多年聽到的，記下的，悟到的，繼續鑽研，已經足以立身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我若志不在此，《武典》已成，就該去找些自己喜歡的事情做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_791_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“人生當行長路。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他這一生，總是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恣意的相逢越多，不得貪戀的糾葛也就越多。\n人重於器，獸憫於情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將軍，軍令傳達完畢，救災工作已經展開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......日落了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，望烽節......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天是最後一天，但為了備戰天災，軍中暫停了烽火傳鼓的儀式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您看，是否要繼續？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩鬢斑白的將軍望向城外，大漠茫茫，什麼都看不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......今日，我親自擊鼓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將軍，您鎮守在城樓一整天了，還是去休息吧，我們來就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關山路遠，總得有人為他送行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幾行歸塞盡，念爾獨何之？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鼓聲響了起來。\n沉悶、清晰、悠遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "十七通鼓，象徵著過去一年裡玉門經歷過的大小劫難。\n天災剛剛過去，風暴過境，天空中所有雜亂的顏色也被捲走。\n雲霞被落日燙紅，半天飛錦。\n他就這麼走著，腳印一點點被風沙抹平，偌大的玉門城在他身後，也一點點地小了下去。\n咚——\n第十八聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他驀地停下了腳步，但沒有回頭。\n第十八聲鼓，象徵著玉門剛剛安然渡過的又一場天災。\n以及......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g11_yumendesert"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "終於逃出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多虧你提前打探清楚了巡防營的活動規律，不然我們也得折在裡面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮靜的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛收到諦獸的傳信，頭領他們已經動身前往下一站，我們趕緊去跟大家會合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮靜的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咬牙切齒）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮靜的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門啊玉門，下一次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你看那邊那個人，是不是幾次壞了我們好事的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮靜的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你跟蹤我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟蹤？我只是離開玉門，在這裡歇歇腳而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過偏偏又遇上了你們，也是有緣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮靜的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，送你們上路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再上路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "aliases": [
        "重岳",
        "魏彥吾"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
